{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge","kind":"proposition","title":"Bridge: $z$-Taylor recursion vs $c_k$ ladder recursion — structural correspondence","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-qbeta-per-block-chi-closed-forms","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-k-recursion-from-habiro-q-difference"],"cites":["references/habiro2004","references/wenzl1988"],"tags":["qbeta","z-recursion","ck-recursion","bridge","pre-archimedean","structural"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.z_recursion_forward_form","text":"qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge\"></a><p><em>For any <code>ZRecursionCoeffs</code> instance with Taylor coefficient sequence <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_n</code>, and for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n \\geq 1</code>,</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  a_{n+1} = -\\frac{3n}{2(n+1)} \\cdot a_n -\\frac{2n-1}{4(n+1)} \\cdot a_{n-1}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>The coefficients <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_n</code> are real. The forward form is stated over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{R}</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-z-recursion-to-ck-recursion-bridge.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.8.8"}
